          "text": "The wall label reads, “Please stand at least 2 meters back”—a rule added after the 2019 renovation."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "One curator called the piece “quietly defiant”; another wrote that it “refuses easy categories”—both remarks appear in the catalog, page 14."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Visitors often pause at the note “Oil on panel, c. 1880”—then ask whether the date is approximate or simply unknown."
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
